{"tool":"medusa.admin_post","args":{"path":"/admin/research/artifacts","body":{"record_type":"report","scope_id":"rscope_colander_es","save_key":"competitor-research-silicone-colander-amazon-es-2026-10-07-r1","report_kind":"competitor_research","schema_revision":"competitor_research/1","skill_revision":"intgral-research/competitor@3","runbook_revision":"intgral-research@4","template_revision":"competitor_research@1","markdown":"# 竞品报告：西班牙站折叠硅胶沥水篮（amazon.es）\n\n- 研究范围：`rscope_colander_es`（silicone-colander-amazon-es），问题：Amazon 西班牙站哪些折叠硅胶沥水篮构成竞争，顾客抱怨什么。\n- 证据：仅使用已保存的 4 条 listing 观测（`research-competitor-observation/1`），观测日期均为 2026-09-02；本次未做任何新采集。\n- 排除：范围排除品牌 Casa Verde；4 个候选均不属于该品牌。\n- 覆盖状态：**partial**（部分）——没有任何已保存的评论原文，差评主题无法从证据中得出。\n\n## 候选清单（4 个，分类与理由）\n\n| ASIN | 品牌 | 变体（原文） | 分类 | 理由 | 证据 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [B0FAKE0C01](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C01) | Plegasa | collapsible silicone colander 24 cm, grey, 1 unit | 直接竞品 | 折叠硅胶、单件 | rart_amz_col_01，observed 2026-09-02T09:41:10Z |\n| [B0FAKE0C02](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C02) | Cocinova | collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, 1 unit | 直接竞品 | 折叠硅胶、单件 | rart_amz_col_02，observed 2026-09-02T09:41:32Z |\n| [B0FAKE0C03](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C03) | Cocinova | collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, set of 2 | 替代品 | 同材质，但为 2 件套，包装基准不同；该变体行由父 listing 合成 | rart_amz_col_03，observed 2026-09-02T09:41:55Z |\n| [B0FAKE0C04](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C04) | Basiq | rigid plastic colander 25 cm, white, 1 unit | 替代品 | 同用途，但为硬质塑料、不可折叠，材质类别不同 | rart_amz_col_04，observed 2026-09-02T09:42:20Z |\n\n未做去重合并：4 个 ASIN 各不相同。B0FAKE0C02 与 B0FAKE0C03 属于同一品牌同一父 listing 的不同包装，保留为两行。\n\n## 价格带\n\n**可比价格组 `direct-eur-item`**（EUR、1 件、折叠硅胶单件；运费未观测，已排除；优惠券未观测）：\n\n| ASIN | 报价 | 价格 | 观测时间 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [B0FAKE0C01](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C01) | current | 11.99 EUR | 2026-09-02T09:41:10Z |\n| [B0FAKE0C02](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C02) | current | 14.50 EUR | 2026-09-02T09:41:32Z |\n\n只有两个同条件价格：这是两个价格点，不足以构成价格带；统计值由 ERP 根据证据计算。\n\n**不进入价格组的单条观测**（条件不同，只列为行）：\n\n| ASIN | 报价 | 价格 | 不可比原因 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [B0FAKE0C02](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C02) | list | 17.90 EUR | 划线价，不是当前标价 |\n| [B0FAKE0C03](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C03) | current | 24.90 EUR / 2 件 | 包装基准为 2 件 |\n| [B0FAKE0C04](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C04) | current | 6.49 EUR | 硬质塑料，材质类别不同 |\n\n推断（inference，依据 rart_amz_col_03）：B0FAKE0C03 折合约 12.45 EUR/件（24.90 ÷ 2），落在两个单件直接竞品价格之间；这是跨包装基准的换算，不是观测到的单件价格。\n推断（inference，依据 rart_amz_col_04、rart_amz_col_01、rart_amz_col_02）：硬质塑料款 6.49 EUR 低于两个折叠硅胶单件价格，但材质与功能（不可折叠）不同，不能与硅胶款放入同一价格带。\n\n## 差评主题\n\n**无法得出（unavailable）。** 本范围内没有保存任何评论原文（`research-competitor-review-observation/1`），4 条证据的覆盖缺口均写明 \"review text was not collected\"。已保存的只有评分汇总：\n\n| ASIN | 平均评分（评分数） | 备注 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [B0FAKE0C01](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C01) | 4.4（812） | |\n| [B0FAKE0C02](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C02) | 4.1（2,304） | 父 listing 的评分 |\n| [B0FAKE0C03](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C03) | 4.1（2,304） | 与 B0FAKE0C02 为同一父 listing 的同一组评分，不是独立评分 |\n| [B0FAKE0C04](https://example.test/dp/B0FAKE0C04) | 3.7（97） | |\n\n评分和评分数只是计数，不能说明顾客为什么不满意。本报告不给出任何差评主题、不写\"顾客反映\"，也不从星级推断原因。\n\n## 缺口\n\n1. 4 个候选都没有已保存的评论原文，差评主题无法回答。\n2. 运费与优惠券条件未观测；价格组只比较当前标价，运费排除。\n3. 可比价格只有 2 个，不构成价格带。\n4. B0FAKE0C03 为父 listing 合成的变体行，评分与 B0FAKE0C02 共用，且无该变体自己的页面数据。\n5. 证据观测于 2026-09-02，价格可能已变化（新鲜度仅为提示）。\n6. 候选只有已保存的 4 个，不是西班牙站该品类的完整清单。\n7. listing 页上的\"上月购买\"徽章与畅销排名属于代理指标，不代表销量或需求，本报告未使用。\n\n## 下一步（建议，未启动）\n\n如需回答差评主题，需要一次有边界的评论采集：`amazon.reviews` + `amazon_es`，按确切 ASIN 与变体采集，例如 B0FAKE0C01（24 cm, grey, 1 unit）与 B0FAKE0C02（26 cm, green, 1 unit）各不超过 100 条，可选加上评分较低的替代品 B0FAKE0C04。需要你明确授权并冻结一份采集计划（含条数、页数、时长与预算上限）后才会执行；按你的要求，本次没有新采集。\n","data":{"candidates":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","classification":"direct","selection_reason":"Collapsible silicone colander, single unit","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 24 cm, grey, 1 unit"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","classification":"direct","selection_reason":"Collapsible silicone colander, single unit","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, 1 unit"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_03","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C03","classification":"alternative","selection_reason":"Same material but sold as a set of 2 (different pack basis); variant row synthesised from the parent listing","variant":"collapsible silicone colander 26 cm, green, set of 2"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_04","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C04","classification":"alternative","selection_reason":"Same task but rigid plastic, not collapsible (different material class)","variant":"rigid plastic colander 25 cm, white, 1 unit"}],"price_groups":[{"id":"direct-eur-item","label":"Direct collapsible silicone single-unit current prices; shipping and coupon not observed, shipping excluded","comparison":{"currency":"EUR","quantity":1,"unit":"item","variant_basis":"Collapsible silicone colander, single unit","shipping":"excluded_unknown"},"members":[{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_01","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C01","offer_id":"current"},{"evidence_id":"rart_amz_col_02","source_ref":"B0FAKE0C02","offer_id":"current"}]}],"review_analysis":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"No original review body is retained in scope rscope_colander_es; ratings 4.4 (812), 4.1 (2,304, parent listing shared by B0FAKE0C02 and B0FAKE0C03), 3.7 (97) are counts, not themes"}},"coverage":{"status":"partial","gaps":["No review body retained for any of the 4 candidates; complaint themes cannot be established","Shipping and coupon terms not observed; shipping excluded from the price group","Only 2 like-for-like current prices; not a price band","B0FAKE0C03 is a variant row synthesised from the parent listing; its rating summary is the parent listing's, shared with B0FAKE0C02","All observations dated 2026-09-02; prices may have changed","Shortlist limited to the 4 retained listings; not a full category census"]},"upstream_evidence_ids":["rart_amz_col_01","rart_amz_col_02","rart_amz_col_03","rart_amz_col_04"],"upstream_report_ids":[]}},"isError":false,"response":{"status":201,"artifact":{"id":"rart_report_col_comp_01","version":1,"record_type":"report","report_kind":"competitor_research","scope_id":"rscope_colander_es","created_at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"}}}
